+## Individual due-date extensions
+
+For a named student's extension, resolve the assignment and match the participant by email
+before previewing the recipient and exact new due time. This is a per-student exception, not
+a change to the assignment's common deadline and not a grading cycle. Record the recipient,
+assignment and intended timestamp in the operations audit; apply the same explicit approval,
+test-one, stop-on-error and independent-read verification rules as other writes.
+
